sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Outbox
  participant K as Kafka
  participant F as Fraud Service
  participant FD as Fraud DB
  participant T as Transaction Service
  O->>K: transaction.created.v1
  K->>F: consume
  F->>F: schema + versão + deduplicação
  F->>FD: FraudAnalysis
  F->>K: fraud.analysis.completed.v1
  K->>T: consume com retry
  T->>T: APPROVED / REVIEW / BLOCKED
  T->>T: persiste no PostgreSQL transacional
